{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your patio into a vibrant, cat-filled catio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your catio, unlock over 100 items, and build elaborate custom cat trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/6faca296bd0dfd8d0a1a32a6f4638c15.poster.avif?t=1772460354\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/6faca296bd0dfd8d0a1a32a6f4638c15.webm?t=1772460354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/6faca296bd0dfd8d0a1a32a6f4638c15.mp4?t=1772460354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a Cat Adoption Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet your cats to prepare them for adoption. Once they're ready, collect their adoption fees and send them off to their forever homes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/704921ff6a36c5b864dfcef3379b153f.poster.avif?t=1772460354\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/704921ff6a36c5b864dfcef3379b153f.webm?t=1772460354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/704921ff6a36c5b864dfcef3379b153f.mp4?t=1772460354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Petting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate and improve your petting with a variety of upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo